      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当电压变为零时，电流强度的绝对值达到最大值."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在线圈里电流强度的振幅等于",
        "$I_м=\\frac{U_м}{\\omega L}$ （2.31）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果引入符号",
        "$\\omega L=X_L$ （2.32）",
        "用有效值代替电流强度和电压的振幅，则可得",
        "$I=\\frac{U}{X_L}$ （2.33）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**■ $X_L$ 即角频率和自感系数的乘积叫做感抗.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据公式（2.33），电流强度的有效值与电压的有效值和",
        "感抗间的关系与直流电路中的欧姆定律类似."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**感抗与频率有关**. 稳恒电流一般“不能察觉”线圈的电感.",
        "在 $\\omega=0$ 时，**感抗 $X_L=0$**. 电压变化越快，自感电动势就越大，",
        "**电流的振幅就越小**."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "26. 交流电路的欧姆定律"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们现在来研究电路的更普遍的情况，即纯电阻为 $R$",
        "而电感很小的导体、电感 $L$ 很大而有效电阻很小的线圈及电"
      ]
    },
